message: "If you use AEOS in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "Active Entity Ontology for Science (AEOS)"
abstract: >-
  A portable, versioned ontology of active and informational entities, their
  roles, affordances, states, and interaction motifs in scientific
  ecosystems, with validated local data, a JSON Schema contract, and a
  deterministic JSON export.
authors:
  - name: "Active Inference Institute"
date-released: "2026-07-17"
version: "1.0.0"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.7484994"
license: "CC-BY-4.0"
keywords:
  - ontology
  - active inference
  - decentralized science
  - entities
  - motifs
